      "title": "Opening: items go on the shelf, and the server picks random items",
      "description": "### Opening: items go on the shelf, and the server picks random items\n\n**DSA topic:** 5. Merkle tree\n\nAbout 10% of the items are chosen at random **by the server**, so no one knows in advance which ones will be checked. Each comes with its **Merkle proof**."
    },
