      },
      "title": "Merkle proof: proving one item was in the carton",
      "description": "### Merkle proof: proving one item was in the carton\n\n**DSA topic:** 5. Merkle tree\n\nThe proof is just the sibling hash at each level: O(log n) hashes. Hashing up from the item must reach the signed root."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/ScanAct.tsx",
